      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Toast in the preheated oven until pepitas start to turn golden brown and become fragrant, about 5 minutes. Let cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine 1/3 cup olive oil, vinegar, sugar, mustard, mayonnaise, shallot, and black pepper together in a container with a tight-fitting lid. Screw on lid tightly and shake dressing vigorously.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
